  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar mini grid on Ssesse island; the project will increase access to local and sustainable sources of electricity, foster business creation, and improve household income by providing energy that can be purchased for less than the price of fossil fuels currently being used.</narrative>
